OL,3,APope Leo speaks of community
OL,4,A'suffering' on visit to remote Andes
OL,5,Atown
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt an outdoor Mass, the Pope spoke of
OL,8,F"declining birth rates that are
OL,9,Femptying villages" and the unequal
OL,10,Fdistribution of the land's resources.
OL,12,FMore than 40% of the population in the
OL,13,FCajamarca region, where the town is
OL,14,Flocated, live in poverty - the highest
OL,15,Ffigure in Peru, according to official
OL,16,Fdata.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
